post_install() {
  cat <<EOF

SkillSpector is installed as a self-contained venv in /usr/lib/skillspector.

Quick start:
  skillspector scan <skill-directory>           full scan (static + LLM analysis)
  skillspector scan <skill-directory> --no-llm  static checks only (no API key needed)
  skillspector --help                           all commands and options

Configuration is done via environment variables (no config file):
  SKILLSPECTOR_PROVIDER     LLM provider (openai, anthropic, ollama, ...)
  SKILLSPECTOR_MODEL        model name
  SKILLSPECTOR_OUTPUT_LANGUAGE  report language
LLM analysis requires an API key: OPENAI_API_KEY (+ optional OPENAI_BASE_URL),
the active provider's key (e.g. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY), or SKILLSPECTOR_PROVIDER=ollama
for local models.
Baseline (false-positive suppression) can be supplied with: --baseline <file>
EOF
}
